UID:54f53fe5c91564e2@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260727T160011Z
DTSTART:20260813T170000Z
DTEND:20260813T200000Z
SUMMARY:BurbSec Southeast - Sponsored by Check Point!
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events ## Thank you to our sponsors [Check Point](https://checkpoint.com)!!! 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec Southeast! 🍻🎉** Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec Southeast is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec Southeast\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec Southeast who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 5 pm\, and we keep the vibe going for a few hours. 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. * BurbSec Discord: [https://discord.gg/invite/VVYDZYmd2w](https://discord.gg/invite/VVYDZYmd2w) (Bridged with Slack!) * Web: [burbsec.com](http://burbsec.com/) * Twitter:[ @burbsecSE](https://x.com/burbsecSE) * BlueSky: [@southeast.burbsec.com](https://bsky.app/profile/burbsecsoutheast.bsky.social) Get ready for a night of laughs\, geekiness\, and unforgettable moments! See you there! | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315579045/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315579045/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:64b6e30debaf8d83@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260727T160011Z
DTSTART:20260813T180000Z
DTEND:20260813T210000Z
SUMMARY:Burbsec South - Sponsors Wanted
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec South! 🍻🎉** Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec South is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec South\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec South who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 6 pm\, and we keep the vibe going for a couple of hours\, then a small group often heads out to another local pub for further shenanigans. 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. * BurbSec Discord: [https://discord.gg/invite/VVYDZYmd2w](https://discord.gg/invite/VVYDZYmd2w) (Bridged with Slack!) * Web: [burbsec.com](http://burbsec.com/) * Twitter: [@burbsecsouth](https://x.com/burbsecsouth) * Mastodon: [@BurbSecSouth@infosec.exchange](https://infosec.exchange/deck/@burbsecsouth) Get ready for a night of laughs\, geekiness\, and unforgettable moments! See you there! | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315825866/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/315825866/
END:VEVENT
